OL,3,GNEWSAHow a shed become an icon of
OL,4,Abroadcasting history
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was a time when Jack Hargreaves'
OL,7,Frustic potting shed was famous.
OL,9,FIn the 1960s and 1970s, Hargreaves
OL,10,Fpresented TV show Out of Town, a
OL,11,Fsuccessful weekly documentary about
OL,12,Ftraditional country life.
OL,14,FHe would sit in a mocked-up shed, built
OL,15,Finside a television studio, instantly
OL,16,Frecognisable with his white beard,
OL,17,Fbriar pipe and wax jacket.
