OL,3,GNEWSAHow a shed become an icon of
OL,4,Abroadcasting history
OL,5,
OL,6,FLater episodes were filmed in his
OL,7,Factual shed at his home in Belchalwell,
OL,8,FDorset, with the show regularly beating
OL,9,FCoronation Street in the ratings across
OL,10,Fthe south of England.
